WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
[Light original instrumental music]
You have 1 new holiday. An inbox becomes a suitcase.

00:07.500 --> 00:15.000
Marc, we made you a department.
Three imaginary office doors appear.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.500
The sun handles lighting.
A geometric sun wears sunglasses.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.000
Barcelona. Out of office.
Buildings rise and a coffee arrives.

00:30.000 --> 00:37.500
Sitges. Into the blue.
A suitcase rests beneath a parasol by the waves.

00:37.500 --> 00:45.000
The cushion will chair this meeting.
A cushion settles on a chair. Action items: zero.

00:45.000 --> 00:52.500
Your five-year plan? Five more minutes.
A hammock sways. Five dots bob slowly.

00:52.500 --> 01:00.000
Merca Stay. The art of doing absolutely nothing.
Made by Jordi. With affection. Unofficial affectionate parody.
